@startuml sequence-browse-cars
skinparam backgroundColor white
title Sequence — Browse & filter cars (UC3)

actor Customer
participant "Frontend\n(React SPA)" as FE
participant "REST API\n(FastAPI)" as API
database "Database\n(SQLite)" as DB

Customer -> FE: Open the app
FE -> API: GET /cars/
API -> DB: SELECT all cars\n(ordered by brand, model)
DB --> API: cars
API --> FE: 200 OK [cars]
FE --> Customer: Car grid\n(photo, branch, price/day, price/hour, specs)

opt apply a filter
  Customer -> FE: Choose category, transmission,\nfuel type, price range or branch (F11)
  FE -> API: GET /cars/?category=...&transmission=...\n&fuel_type=...&min_price=...&max_price=...&branch_id=...
  API -> DB: SELECT cars matching the filters\n(price range compares the daily price)
  DB --> API: matching cars
  API --> FE: 200 OK [cars]
end

FE --> Customer: See (updated) car grid
@enduml
